WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.951
Welcome to OpenRound.

00:00:01.951 --> 00:00:03.833
Your workspace keeps Rounds,

00:00:03.833 --> 00:00:06.320
Presentations, Sessions, Assignments,

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:08.941
Results, Discover, and Groups together.

00:00:08.941 --> 00:00:11.441
Use Create whenever you are ready to
begin.

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:14.732
For a new Round, choose a starter,

00:00:14.732 --> 00:00:17.761
bring a trusted source, import structured

00:00:17.761 --> 00:00:19.312
work, or start blank.

00:00:19.312 --> 00:00:22.106
Every route creates a reviewable draft.

00:00:22.106 --> 00:00:24.427
Nothing publishes automatically.

00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:27.847
The Round Builder keeps the question map,

00:00:27.847 --> 00:00:30.539
direct-edit canvas, and inspector in view.

00:00:30.539 --> 00:00:32.898
Write the prompt and answers, mark the

00:00:32.898 --> 00:00:35.257
correct response, then use Diagnose to

00:00:35.257 --> 00:00:37.678
require confidence and tag the concepts

00:00:37.678 --> 00:00:38.920
you want to measure.

00:00:39.694 --> 00:00:42.386
Use Recover to add a fresh recheck.

00:00:42.386 --> 00:00:45.100
OpenRound links the diagnostic and recheck

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:49.299
so reports can show whether understanding
improved after support.

00:00:49.299 --> 00:00:52.781
Resolve the readiness items and wait for
Saved.

00:00:53.561 --> 00:00:56.052
Preview the learner experience, publish

00:00:56.052 --> 00:00:58.606
the exact saved revision, then return to

00:00:58.606 --> 00:01:00.778
Library to host live or assign the

00:01:00.778 --> 00:01:02.822
Round for account-free practice.

00:01:02.822 --> 00:01:04.263
You are ready to try it.
